`etude-3xt` was worked end to end by a **real `workmux` worker lane** and gated by
this supervisor from a different worktree. It landed on `origin/main` as
**`752be1a`** (6 files, +457/−20) and the worker closed the bead itself.

- Lane: `lane/3xt-retro-ref` at `.worktrees/lane-3xt`, created with
