- **10 attempts. 5 produced by `etude gate` alone; all 5 escalated.**
- **All 5 escalations are the same cause**: the `opus` seat recorded `failed`
  because it cannot be invoked as a subprocess.
- **5 attempts completed out of band; all 5 passed.**
- **`etude gate` alone passed zero of five gates.** Every single passing verdict
